### T2.5 — `MuteButton`
**File:** `src/lib/components/__tests__/MuteButton.svelte.test.ts` *(new)* — Pattern C, plus a
`MuteButtonHost.test.svelte` because `muted` is `$bindable`.

- `it('shows a bell when not muted and a bell-off when muted')` — assert on the accessible name
  (`aria-label`), not on the icon's markup.
- `it('opens the duration modal on click when not muted')`
- `it('POSTs an indefinite mute for the "until i turn it back on" option')` — stub `global.fetch`,
  assert the body is `{target, kind, until: 0}`.
- `it('POSTs an absolute timestamp for the 8-hour option')` — use `vi.useFakeTimers()` and
  `vi.setSystemTime()`; assert `until === now + 8*3600_000`.
- `it('DELETEs without opening the modal when already muted')` — unmuting is one click, not two.
- `it('flips the bound muted flag only after the server accepts')`
- `it('leaves the bound flag alone when the request fails')` — the UI must never claim a mute the
  server rejected.
- `it('disables the button while a request is in flight')`

---

