════════════════════════ STEP: profile-settings ════════════════════════

## T10 — Profile notification settings

**File:** `src/routes/app/profile/__tests__/page.svelte.test.ts` *(new)* — Pattern C.

- `it('lists every muted user and room')`
- `it('shows an empty state when nothing is muted')`
- `it('unmutes on click and removes the row')`
- `it('keeps the row when the unmute request fails')`
- `it('still renders a mute whose target no longer exists')` — falls back to the raw id, so a
  dangling mute can still be cleared rather than being stuck forever.
- `it('shows the expiry for a temporary mute')`
- `it('shows no expiry for an indefinite mute')`
- `it('shows the current push state')`
- `it('enables push when the toggle is switched on')`
- `it('disables push when the toggle is switched off')` — `disable_push` is exported from
  `src/lib/push-client.ts` and **has no caller anywhere in the app**; this test is what makes it
  real.
- `it('explains rather than offering a toggle when push is blocked')`
- `it('explains rather than offering a toggle when push is unsupported')`

